Package: abcclock
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, curl
Description: Qt6 hover desktop clock
 A frameless, always-on-top desktop clock overlay: analog dial, weekday,
 date, three city timezones and three city weather lines.
 It runs as a native Wayland wlr-layer-shell overlay surface when built with
 LayerShellQt (keyboard-interactivity=none, so it never steals focus), and
 falls back to an override-redirect X11/XWayland window otherwise. Provides a
 StatusNotifierItem tray menu (show/hide, settings, run-at-login, quit).
